{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "2f6a8c41-93d7-4b58-a2e9-7c1d5b3f6e84",
  "Description": "Renders a live video stream as a navigable 2.5D point cloud: Depth Anything 3 estimates per-pixel depth, DepthToPoints unprojects it into camera-space splats (size and opacity from depth and confidence), and DrawPoints billboards them into a RenderTarget. Orbit or move the Camera to look around the scene. Stabilize a stationary camera with DepthToPoints.TemporalSmoothing; rebuild from stills with TemporalSmoothing 0.",
  "SymbolTags": "10",
